    "description": "Your status within the SpyNet gives you access to additional resources, and you know the best sources for <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Restricted\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Restricted\">Restricted</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rare\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rare\">Rare</a> items. With a successful DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gather_Information\" title=\"Gather Information\">Gather Information</a> check, you can purchase standard weapons, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a>, and transport services at 50% of the going rate, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rare\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rare\">Rare</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Restricted\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Restricted\">Restricted</a> weapons, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a>, and transport services at 75% of the going rate.",
